MAIN
MOVE TEMP 13 4
MOVE TEMP 14 HALLOCATE TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 4
MOVE TEMP 16 HALLOCATE TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 Fac_ved_ComputeFac
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 19 5
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 19
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 3 0
MOVE TEMP 20 CALL TEMP 4 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 2 )
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 20
PRINT TEMP 5
END
Fac_ved_ComputeFac [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 21 1
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 21
MOVE TEMP 22 LE TEMP 1 TEMP 4
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 22
CJUMP TEMP 5 L1
MOVE TEMP 23 1
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 6
JUMP L2
L1  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 24 1
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 24
MOVE TEMP 25 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 7
MOVE TEMP 8 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 8
HLOAD TEMP 9 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
MOVE TEMP 26 CALL TEMP 10 ( TEMP 0 TEMP 3 )
MOVE TEMP 11 TEMP 26
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 27 TIMES TEMP 1 TEMP 3
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 27
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 12
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 2
END

